  ],
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is a real number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>}</mo></math>. Then which of the following is <strong>NOT</strong> correct?</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "jWIAY",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ngrl8",
      "text": "&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />&nbsp;",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "sa8zn",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pQOjw",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi></math>&nbsp;is purely real, so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>And,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence this is the required option.</p></blockquote>",
